@baseUrl = http://localhost:5128
@HostAddress = {{baseUrl}}
@superAdminEmail = admin@amanix.com
@superAdminPassword = Admin@123456

### =====================================================================
### 08. TENANT SUBSCRIPTION ACTIVATION PATHWAYS TEST SUITE
### =====================================================================
### Covers all 3 activation pathways: ManualPlatformApproval(1), ElectronicPayment(2),
### BankTransferReceipt(3) — plus the secured local file-serving endpoint (FilesController)
### and the Platform HQ governance review screen (PlatformTenantsController).
### Requires FeatureToggles:IsOtpReturnInsideTheResponse=true and
### PaymentSettings:BypassInDevelopment=true (both default true in Development).

### =====================================================================
### 8.1 PLATFORM STAFF LOGIN (for review/approval endpoints)
### =====================================================================

### 8.1.1 Login as Platform SystemSuperAdmin - Expect 200 OK
# @name superAdminLogin
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "email": "{{superAdminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{superAdminPassword}}"
}

@superAdminToken = {{superAdminLogin.response.body.data.Token}}

### =====================================================================
### 8.2 PATHWAY 1: ELECTRONIC PAYMENT (Moyasar, Development Mock Bypass)
### =====================================================================

### 8.2.1 Register Tenant with ActivationMethod=2 (ElectronicPayment) - Expect 200 OK
# @name registerPayment
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "companyName": "Riyadh Fire Protection Co.",
  "subdomain": "riyadh-fire-pay",
  "commercialRecord": "7001000001",
  "adminFullName": "Omar Al-Salem",
  "adminEmail": "omar@riyadh-fire-pay.com",
  "adminPhoneNumber": "+966501000001",
  "password": "SecureAdmin@123456",
  "activationMethod": 2
}

@paymentTenantId = {{registerPayment.response.body.data.tenantId}}
@paymentAdminUserId = {{registerPayment.response.body.data.adminUserId}}
@paymentOtp = {{registerPayment.response.body.data.devOnlyOtp}}

### 8.2.2 Verify OTP - Expect 200 OK, ActivationStatus = PendingPaymentConfirmation (3)
# @name verifyPaymentOtp
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "userId": "{{paymentAdminUserId}}",
  "otpCode": "{{paymentOtp}}"
}

### 8.2.3 Confirm Electronic Payment (Mock Bypass auto-confirms) - Expect 200 OK, Tenant fully Activated
# @name confirmPayment
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{paymentTenantId}}/activation/confirm-payment
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "paymentReferenceId": "MOCK-TEST-REFERENCE-001"
}

### 8.2.4 Confirm Payment Again (Already Activated, Wrong State) - Expect 400 Bad Request
# @name confirmPaymentAlreadyActivated
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{paymentTenantId}}/activation/confirm-payment
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

{
  "paymentReferenceId": "MOCK-TEST-REFERENCE-002"
}

### =====================================================================
### 8.3 PATHWAY 2: BANK TRANSFER RECEIPT (Platform Staff Review)
### =====================================================================

### 8.3.1 Register Tenant with ActivationMethod=3 (BankTransferReceipt) - Expect 200 OK
# @name registerBankTransfer
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "companyName": "Jeddah Safety Contractors",
  "subdomain": "jeddah-safety-bt",
  "commercialRecord": "7001000002",
  "adminFullName": "Layla Al-Otaibi",
  "adminEmail": "layla@jeddah-safety-bt.com",
  "adminPhoneNumber": "+966501000002",
  "password": "SecureAdmin@123456",
  "activationMethod": 3
}

@bankTenantId = {{registerBankTransfer.response.body.data.tenantId}}
@bankAdminUserId = {{registerBankTransfer.response.body.data.adminUserId}}
@bankOtp = {{registerBankTransfer.response.body.data.devOnlyOtp}}

### 8.3.2 Verify OTP - Expect 200 OK, ActivationStatus = PendingReceiptReview (4)
# @name verifyBankOtp
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "userId": "{{bankAdminUserId}}",
  "otpCode": "{{bankOtp}}"
}

@bankAuthToken = {{verifyBankOtp.response.body.data.Token}}

### 8.3.3 Upload Bank Transfer Receipt (multipart/form-data) - Expect 200 OK
# @name uploadReceipt
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{bankTenantId}}/activation/bank-transfer-receipt
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AmanixBoundary

------AmanixBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="receipt"; filename="transfer-receipt.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Mock bank transfer receipt content — SAR 4,500 transferred on 2026-08-17.
------AmanixBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="transactionReference"

TRX-SNB-2026-88123
------AmanixBoundary--

### 8.3.4 Platform Admin Lists Tenants Pending Review - Expect 200 OK, includes jeddah-safety-bt
# @name getPendingActivations
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/platform/tenants/pending-activation
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

### 8.3.5 Platform Admin Approves the Bank Transfer Receipt - Expect 200 OK, Tenant Activated
# @name approveBankTransfer
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/platform/tenants/{{bankTenantId}}/approve-activation
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "approve": true,
  "rejectionReason": null
}

### 8.3.6 Fetch the Uploaded Receipt via Secured Files Endpoint (Tenant Admin, own tenant) - Expect 200 OK
GET {{HostAddress}}{{uploadReceipt.response.body.data.receiptUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bankAuthToken}}
Accept: application/octet-stream

### 8.3.7 Fetch the Same Receipt as Platform SystemSuperAdmin (cross-tenant review) - Expect 200 OK
GET {{HostAddress}}{{uploadReceipt.response.body.data.receiptUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Accept: application/octet-stream

### =====================================================================
### 8.4 PATHWAY 3: MANUAL PLATFORM APPROVAL + REJECTION FLOW
### =====================================================================

### 8.4.1 Register Tenant with ActivationMethod=1 (ManualPlatformApproval) - Expect 200 OK
# @name registerManual
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "companyName": "Dammam Industrial Safety",
  "subdomain": "dammam-safety-manual",
  "commercialRecord": "7001000003",
  "adminFullName": "Khalid Al-Dosari",
  "adminEmail": "khalid@dammam-safety-manual.com",
  "adminPhoneNumber": "+966501000003",
  "password": "SecureAdmin@123456",
  "activationMethod": 1
}

@manualTenantId = {{registerManual.response.body.data.tenantId}}
@manualAdminUserId = {{registerManual.response.body.data.adminUserId}}
@manualOtp = {{registerManual.response.body.data.devOnlyOtp}}

### 8.4.2 Verify OTP - Expect 200 OK, ActivationStatus = PendingManualApproval (2)
# @name verifyManualOtp
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "userId": "{{manualAdminUserId}}",
  "otpCode": "{{manualOtp}}"
}

### 8.4.3 Platform Admin Rejects Activation (Missing Reason) - Expect 400 Bad Request
# @name rejectManualMissingReason
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/platform/tenants/{{manualTenantId}}/approve-activation
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

{
  "approve": false,
  "rejectionReason": null
}

### 8.4.4 Platform Admin Rejects Activation (With Reason) - Expect 200 OK, Status = Rejected
# @name rejectManual
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/platform/tenants/{{manualTenantId}}/approve-activation
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "approve": false,
  "rejectionReason": "Commercial Registration could not be verified against the Ministry of Commerce registry."
}

### =====================================================================
### 8.5 NEGATIVE & CROSS-PATHWAY TESTS
### =====================================================================

### 8.5.1 Upload Bank Transfer Receipt on a ManualPlatformApproval Tenant (Wrong Pathway) - Expect 400 Bad Request
# @name uploadReceiptWrongPathway
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{manualTenantId}}/activation/bank-transfer-receipt
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AmanixBoundary

------AmanixBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="receipt"; filename="receipt.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Should be rejected - wrong pathway.
------AmanixBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="transactionReference"

TRX-WRONG-PATHWAY
------AmanixBoundary--

### 8.5.2 Confirm Payment on a BankTransferReceipt Tenant (Wrong Pathway) - Expect 400 Bad Request
# @name confirmPaymentWrongPathway
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{bankTenantId}}/activation/confirm-payment
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
  "paymentReferenceId": "SHOULD-FAIL"
}

### 8.5.3 Non-Existent Tenant Approval Attempt - Expect 404 Not Found
# @name approveNonExistentTenant
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/platform/tenants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/approve-activation
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: ar

{
  "approve": true,
  "rejectionReason": null
}

### 8.5.4 Pending Activations List WITHOUT Token - Expect 401 Unauthorized
# @name getPendingActivationsNoToken
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/platform/tenants/pending-activation
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

### 8.5.5 Pending Activations List as a Non-Platform Role (Tenant Admin) - Expect 403 Forbidden
# @name getPendingActivationsForbidden
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/platform/tenants/pending-activation
Authorization: Bearer {{bankAuthToken}}
Accept: application/json
Accept-Language: en

### 8.5.6 Fetch a Tenant's Receipt as an UNRELATED Tenant Admin - Expect 403 Forbidden
### bankAuthToken belongs to the BankTransferReceipt tenant admin; the path below is scoped
### to a DIFFERENT tenant folder (paymentTenantId), so cross-tenant access must be denied.
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/files/uploads/tenants/{{paymentTenantId}}/activation-receipts/does-not-matter.txt
Authorization: Bearer {{bankAuthToken}}
Accept: application/octet-stream
